# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# UNIFIED CADDYFILE — optional edge: static panels + reverse-proxied backend
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# NOTE ON DEPLOY PATHS: the Railway/Dockerfile path does NOT use Caddy — the Node
# process serves the API and the built panels itself (railway.json / Dockerfile
# CMD = `node backend/server.js`). This Caddyfile is for a SELF-HOSTED edge where
# Caddy terminates TLS (HTTP/2 + HTTP/3 on by default), serves the static panel
# bundles, and reverse-proxies everything dynamic to the Node backend.
#
# AQ-12 (2026-07-13) FIX: the previous version served only static files and had
# NO reverse_proxy — used as written, /api, realtime, health and uploads were
# all unreachable. It now proxies them to the backend upstream.
#
# Routing:
#   /api/*, /socket.io/*, /health*, /metrics, /app-assets/*, /storage/*
#                → Node backend ({$BACKEND_UPSTREAM}, default localhost:8080)
#   /admin/*     → admin-panel/dist   (SPA)
#   /merchant/*  → merchant-panel/dist (SPA)
#   /*           → dist                (user panel SPA)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:{$PORT}

# Proxy-level response compression. zstd preferred, gzip fallback.
encode zstd gzip

# Edge-terminated security headers. HSTS belongs here (TLS terminates at Caddy);
# the app sets its own CSP/helmet headers on API responses.
header {
    Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains"
    X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
    Referrer-Policy "no-referrer"
    -Server
}

# Item 29 (multi-domain): this block is HOST-AGNOSTIC (:{$PORT}); every custom
# domain attached to the service serves identical content. Canonical-URL
# normalization is app-side via CANONICAL_HOST (network.config.js).

# ── Dynamic → Node backend (API, realtime, health, metrics, app-managed assets)
# Caddy v2 proxies WebSockets (socket.io) and SSE (/api/sse) transparently —
# it auto-detects the Upgrade header and streams event-stream responses.
@backend path /api/* /socket.io/* /health* /metrics /app-assets/* /storage/*
handle @backend {
    reverse_proxy {$BACKEND_UPSTREAM:localhost:8080}
}

# ── Admin Panel (static SPA) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
handle /admin* {
    uri strip_prefix /admin
    root * /app/admin-panel/dist
    file_server
    try_files {path} /index.html
}

# ── Merchant Panel (static SPA) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
handle /merchant* {
    uri strip_prefix /merchant
    root * /app/merchant-panel/dist
    file_server
    try_files {path} /index.html
}

# ── User Panel (static SPA, catch-all) ───────────────────────────────────────
handle {
    root * /app/dist
    file_server
    try_files {path} /index.html
}
